19664064049720764, -0.027171006426215172, 0.010316094383597374, -0.01518846582621336, 0.0075823296792805195, -0.035582590848207474, -0.005991270300000906, 0.0033031341154128313, 0.01144292950630188, 0.03463033586740494, 0.006816558074206114, -0.009768548421561718, -0.011181059293448925, -0.004031212534755468, -0.004078825004398823, -7.148111035348848e-05, -0.006538816727697849, 0.0007052637520246208, -0.01679142750799656, 0.02910725772380829, 0.031059380620718002, -0.006927654147148132, -0.03320195525884628, 0.025361722335219383, 0.019013356417417526, -0.007491071708500385, -0.004650177899748087, -0.016585106030106544, 0.0004081800871063024, 0.025821978226304054, 0.017854779958724976, -0.012331700883805752, 0.037137940526008606, -0.010443061590194702, -0.009768548421561718, 0.003773309988901019, 0.0048088873736560345, -0.0011655202833935618, -0.009221001528203487, 0.0020929768215864897, -0.007875941693782806, 0.023330245167016983, 0.011157252825796604, 0.015950269997119904, -0.014918659813702106, 0.006887977011501789, 0.0022298635449260473, 0.02677423320710659, -0.035519108176231384, 0.002636555815115571, -0.0011010447051376104, -0.003735616570338607, 0.0020652026869356632, 0.005943657830357552, 0.0018995500868186355, -0.020171932876110077, -0.0313609279692173, 0.008229069411754608, -0.020901994779706, 0.03821716457605362, 0.00789577979594469, 0.013760083355009556, 0.013553760945796967, 0.0212035421282053, -0.01818806864321232, 0.006157915107905865, -0.01648988015949726, 0.011577832512557507, -0.010324030183255672, -0.018553098663687706, 0.048184096813201904, -0.0032674246467649937, -0.002922232262790203, 0.007574394345283508, 0.0013450600672513247, 0.011355639435350895, 0.025425205007195473, 0.003170215291902423, 0.02107657492160797, -0.004618436098098755, 0.008617906831204891, 0.011387381702661514, 0.01576775312423706, 0.009728871285915375, 0.049739446491003036, -0.005999205633997917, -0.019822772592306137, -0.008094166405498981, 0.020981349050998688, -0.03739187493920326, -0.0069871703162789345, 0.02690120041370392, -0.02079089917242527, 0.009276549331843853, 0.01600581780076027, -0.027091652154922485, -0.012903054244816303, -0.0019560903310775757, 0.0059119160287082195, 0.004229598678648472, -0.021108316257596016, -0.004110566806048155, -0.03555084764957428, 0.0165533646941185, -0.014180662110447884, 0.02863113023340702, 0.025536302477121353, -0.017632586881518364, 0.011387381702661514, 0.03780451789498329, -0.020124319940805435, 0.009022614918649197, 0.012196797877550125, -0.018505487591028214], "index": 9, "object": "embedding"}], "model": "text-embedding-3-small", "object": "list", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8000, "total_tokens": 8000}}, "input": {"input": ["-08-29T19:13:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: That lines up with the sharp snap I think I heard on my recording. Save all your notes. Every detail matters now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m41b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:13:46+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Cover him with blankets. Please, keep the curious onlookers back. Show some respect.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m41c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:14:11+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The Harbour Police launch is approaching. Their blue lights are reflecting off the hull. It’s a grim sight.</body>\n    </message>\n\n    <message id=\"m42\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:14:29+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It was a tragic accident. He was helping me with a rope. A huge swell just hit us out of nowhere.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m43\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:15:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The police are waiting for us at the quay. They’re going to want detailed statements from everyone.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m44\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:15:50+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I just found Liam’s phone in Marcus’s jacket pocket. What is going on?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m45\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:16:07+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That’s— It’s not what it looks like. I can explain. I swear.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m45a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:16:14+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Then say what it is, Marcus, because this looks absolutely awful. You need to start talking. Now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m45b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:16:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Everyone just take a deep breath. We need to be precise and calm for the officers. Panicking won't help.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m46\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:16:33+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Officers boarding. Phones away.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"2\" title=\"Quay Questions\">\n    <message id=\"m47\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:36:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We're in the station lounge. The officers want a clean and precise timeline from all of us. No discrepancies.</body>\n    </message>\n    <", " away.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"2\" title=\"Quay Questions\">\n    <message id=\"m47\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:36:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We're in the station lounge. The officers want a clean and precise timeline from all of us. No discrepancies.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m47a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:36:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They’ve split us up. We’re not supposed to be talking to each other. Texting isn’t talking, right?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m47b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:36:33+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The detective with the navy blue tie keeps asking who touched what, and exactly when. He's very methodical.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m47c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:36:45+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The waiting room vending machine just ate my coins. This place is somehow colder than the ferry was.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m47d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:36:57+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They want to take our phones for a bit-by-bit copy. Is that a normal procedure? It feels invasive.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m47e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:37:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Officer said the earlier 18:21 alert was an unattended bag alarm at the quay. Logged and cleared.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m48\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:36:51+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: The bruise on Liam’s wrist was thin and circumferential. Like a line, not a thick rope. Important detail.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m48a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:37:14+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: The impression had a uniform depth. It wasn't frayed. That rules out a hemp or nylon mooring rope.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m48b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:37:29+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <body>DM: So, a thin line under extreme tension. Got it. I'll remember that. Thanks, Priya.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m49\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:38:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I had my recorder on near the stern at 18:50. It might have caught some background voices or sounds.</body>\n      <attachment type=\"audio\" file=\"REC_20250829_185", " that. Thanks, Priya.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m49\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:38:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I had my recorder on near the stern at 18:50. It might have caught some background voices or sounds.</body>\n      <attachment type=\"audio\" file=\"REC_20250829_185000.wav\" meta=\"44.1kHz;mono;timecode-synced\"/>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m49a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:38:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I remember hearing a metallic rattle, then the wind, and then someone saying “careful” very quietly.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m49b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:38:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Was your recorder’s time synced? The phone network should have it pretty close to accurate.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m49c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:38:56+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: It auto-syncs. It should be within a few seconds at the absolute worst. It’s reliable.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m50\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:39:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They asked me about the backpack. Who was the first person to see it? They're focusing on that.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m50a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:39:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I was. Black canvas, with paint flecks on the strap. I made a point not to touch it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m50b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:39:52+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>An officer took a statement from me about it around 19:20. They’re checking the lost property logs.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m50c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:40:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They also asked who walked past it the most. That could have been any one of us. We were all over the deck.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m51\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:39:45+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I did. It was under the stern bench. Liam specifically told me to leave it for lost property.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m51a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:40:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They keep circling back to why Liam’s phone was in my jacket. I honestly don’t know. I’m baffled.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message", ". Liam specifically told me to leave it for lost property.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m51a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:40:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They keep circling back to why Liam’s phone was in my jacket. I honestly don’t know. I’m baffled.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m51b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:40:43+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Maybe he asked you to hold it for a moment? People do that when they're taking photos. It's plausible.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m51c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:41:00+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He wouldn’t give up his phone in the middle of a shift. He logs everything on it. It was his lifeline.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m51d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:41:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>When the ferry lurched, his phone slid by my boot near the rail. I grabbed it and shoved it in my jacket to keep it dry.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m51e\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:41:38+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I saw Marcus pick something up then. I thought it was trash. It could have been the phone.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m51f\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:41:49+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That at least explains the pocket. Say it the same way to the detectives.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m52\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:41:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <body>DM: Did you put Liam’s phone in my jacket? Why on earth was it there? I need to know.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m53\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:41:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <body>DM: What? No. Of course not. I found it, I told you that. Don't accuse me.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m53a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:42:16+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <body>DM: When exactly did you find it? Before or after the alarm went off? The timing is critical.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m53b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:42:37+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <body>DM: After. It was near the rail. It buzzed in your pocket, I checked it, and then I handed it up. That's all.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m", " critical.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m53b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:42:37+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <body>DM: After. It was near the rail. It buzzed in your pocket, I checked it, and then I handed it up. That's all.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m54\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:43:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He told me at 18:30, \"there’s a package to log later.\" He didn’t say who it was for. He seemed nervous.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m54a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:43:29+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>A \"package\" could mean the backpack. Or it could be a crate on the quay. It's too vague.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m54b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:43:46+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Did he say who told him about it? The captain? Another crew member? A contractor maybe?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m54c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:44:04+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>No. He just said \"later.\" He looked… conflicted. Like he was caught in the middle of something.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m55\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:44:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I never asked him to do anything illegal tonight. We argued, yes. But it wasn't about work. It was personal.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m55a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:44:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>What was it about, then? Don't hold back now, Marcus. We need to know.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m55b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:44:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He wanted to back out of something we had planned. I told him to just wait until the morning.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m55c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:45:16+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Morning would have been so much kinder to all of us. This is a nightmare.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m56\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:45:48+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Is the USB still locked? Any progress on that front?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m57\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:46:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver", " id=\"m56\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:45:48+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Is the USB still locked? Any progress on that front?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m57\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:46:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Yeah, it's phrase-based. Whoever set this up had a flair for the dramatic, and some serious skills.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m57a\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:46:28+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: They asked me about a \"consulting\" payment. Did you mention it to them?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m57b\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:46:46+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Not yet. We need to keep it vague until we understand the full picture. Don't give them everything.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m57c\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:47:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They’re calling us back in, one by one, again. I think I’m next. I’m so tired.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m57d\" ts=\"2025-08-29T19:47:30+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Note: their timeline focus is between 18:49 and 18:52. That’s the critical window. We need to be precise.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"3\" title=\"Loose Ends\">\n    <message id=\"m58\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:12:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Morning. I couldn't sleep at all. I'm backing up the USB image now to try some safer cracks.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m58a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:12:27+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Imaging it as read-only and hashing it. The chain of custody will matter if this goes formal, and it will.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m58b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:12:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Keep the original sealed up tight. Only work on the copy. Journalists get sued for a lot less.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m58c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:13:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Copy that. I’ll store the checksums in a separate note and print them out. A physical paper trail.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m59\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:14:33+10:00\">\n      <sender", "\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:13:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Copy that. I’ll store the checksums in a separate note and print them out. A physical paper trail.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m59\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:14:33+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The police want us back at 11 for a follow-up. Bring anything and everything we remembered overnight. No matter how small.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m59a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:15:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They asked for our clothes from last night, in separate paper bags. Don’t wash anything yet. Forensics.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m59b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:15:49+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll bring the raw audio recorder files. No edits, just the original timestamps. Let them hear it all.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m60\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:16:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Liam’s jacket had a faint smell of turps. Not diesel. It was an art studio kind of smell. Distinct.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m60a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:16:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: The scent was fresh. I was within a metre of him around 18:55, near the stairwell. I'm sure of it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m60b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:17:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Turps could mean freshly painted surfaces or cleaned tools. That's not part of the ferry's regular maintenance routine.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m60c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:17:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Studios and art galleries are thick around the Quay. It’s hardly a smoking gun, Alex. Let's be realistic.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m61\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:19:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Half of Sydney smells like solvents. My museum stores are near paint and chemicals all day long. It's nothing.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m61a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:19:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Which donor were you cataloguing for, Sienna? Your text last night sounded… careful. Calculated, even.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m61b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:20:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref", " ts=\"2025-08-30T08:19:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Which donor were you cataloguing for, Sienna? Your text last night sounded… careful. Calculated, even.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m61b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:20:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It was a private trust. I catalogue the crates, not their provenance. The donor wished to remain anonymous.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m62\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:22:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Meet me at Barangaroo at 9. There’s some context you need before that drive completely ruins me. Please.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m62a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:23:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I'm heading to the Barangaroo foreshore now. If I go quiet, it's because I’m with Marcus. Wish me luck.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m62b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:23:48+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Record him if he volunteers any incriminating information. Don’t prompt him. The chain of evidence is crucial.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m62c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T08:24:31+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: I’ll just take contemporaneous notes. He’s spooked, not chatty. I have to handle this carefully.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m63\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:07:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Marcus says “Harbour Consulting” is a shell company we used to handle customs “facilitation.” Whatever that means.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m63a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:07:42+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He says it was to “smooth over any delays.” Nothing about the contents. But a lot about the fees involved.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m63b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:07:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Did Liam know that these fees existed? Was he involved in that part of it?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m64\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:08:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That’s just a fancy way of saying bribes. Screenshots or it didn’t happen, Alex. We need proof.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m64a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:08:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"", ":08:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That’s just a fancy way of saying bribes. Screenshots or it didn’t happen, Alex. We need proof.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m64a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:08:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll show the statements to the detectives, not here in a group chat. I’m done texting potential evidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m65\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:10:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It all just got away from me. But I didn’t touch Liam. I swear on my life.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m65a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:11:33+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He threatened to go public with what he knew. That gives you a motive. It doesn’t prove the means, though.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m65b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:12:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I argued with words, not with my fists. I walked away from him at 18:49. A crew member can confirm that.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m66\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:14:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: That narrow bruise means a thin line under a lot of tension. It could be fishing line. Strong fishing line.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m66a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:14:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <body>DM: A wire would have cut deeper. So monofilament or something similar. Would you agree with that?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m66b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:15:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: It’s likely. The depth was shallow and perfectly circumferential. A sharp snap and jerk fits the evidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m67\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:16:30+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>What about the backpack inventory? Did anyone hear what was actually inside it? The contents are key.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m67a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:16:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I zoomed in on the photo: the brand tag says “Seacrest.” I can ring around and check for local stockists.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m67b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:17:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The EXIF data shows ISO ", "=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I zoomed in on the photo: the brand tag says “Seacrest.” I can ring around and check for local stockists.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m67b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:17:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The EXIF data shows ISO 3200, at 18:50:39. We can line that up perfectly with Zoe’s audio recording.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m67d\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:17:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Explicit: Photo 18:50:39 vs audio snap 18:50:34. Five‑second delta, consistent with camera clock drift.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m67c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:17:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We are not the police. We should share all of this at 11 and let them do their jobs and handle it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m68\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:17:22+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The officer said it contained \"gloves, a line, and a utility knife, nothing explosive.\" That's all I know.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m68a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:17:44+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Did they specify the type of gloves? Blue nitrile? That’s what evidence technicians use. A crucial detail.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m68b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T09:18:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The officer mentioned blue nitrile gloves. And the line spool was small, high-test fishing grade. Very strong.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"4\" title=\"Tides and Lies\">\n    <message id=\"m69\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:28:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Just out of the debrief. The detective kept circling the times between 18:49 and 18:52. They're closing in.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m69a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:28:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He asked specifically who was standing closest to the stern rail at exactly 18:50. He's looking for an opportunity.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m69b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:29:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I told them Sienna was there for a moment. Then Alex, and then me. We were all there at some point.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m70\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:29:31+10:"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small"}}, "key": "embeddings_aff2dacc504c0457945bab3d78dbf65704a7726c4fdee9a53a55b14625ca82e6_v2"}